  "bugId": "B6",
  "rationale": "bernsteinBasis builds the binomial coefficient from factorials, so factorial(171) overflows to Infinity and the basis becomes Infinity/Infinity = NaN. 30 control points is below that threshold but precision has already degraded; the rewrite should compute the coefficient iteratively (result = result * (n - i) / (i + 1)), which never overflows. makecode-minecraft-geometry-ext already does this.",
